 "stimulus_html": "For the following questions, use the Venn diagram showing the blood types of all donors at a recent mobile blood drive.<br>\n\n<img src=\"exercises/media/a1daec6e48636689.png\" alt=\"A three-set Venn diagram of A, B, and Rh plus overlapping one another is given. The total number of donors equals 128. Set A shows 7; Set B shows 5; Set Rh plus shows 47. Overlapping of sets A and B shows 4, overlapping of sets B and Rh plus shows 12, and overlapping of A and Rh plus shows 40. Overlapping of A, B, and Rh plus shows 3.\">\n",
 "questions": [
